{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unmelted-cosmic-eeve","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/interfaces cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/interfaces/conftest.py:76-85,100-102` — Preserve the no-preseed invariant and why emptiness tests depend on it. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py:1-16,63-70,93-105,168-194,246-251,262-279` — Preserve worktree/ref repointing, local identity reminting, virgin template, and absence of detached maintenance. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/test_write_parity_oracle.py:1-21` — Preserve that every adapter executes the shared expectation and strict xfails expose known gaps. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/write_parity_contract.py:1-18,33-37,56-69,118-129,250-256` — Preserve row-field semantics, adapter-neutral setup, rejection identity, and store-invariance checks. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/conftest.py tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py tests/interfaces/test_write_parity_oracle.py tests/interfaces/write_parity_contract.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"6fc5-fe48-7df9-4c6c","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/interfaces — cohort 01: conftest–write_parity_contract"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571089154739861,"uuid":"51d42a84-46e7-436d-8700-737b561b2f81"}